        "created_at": "2016-02-19T23:49:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"danmarshall14\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/danmarshall14/48/1944_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> danmarshall14:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>…I think acrylic tokens for SotM could get expensive really fast…</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Considering I'm about 2/3 done with laminating all of the cards from 1 of my 2 sets of SotM (at a rate of around 7 cents per card), Sentinels and expensive have already been used in the same sentence in my household. I think it's a cool idea and I'd love to hear a price quote.</p>",
